  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><b>What it is: </b>A dual-ended concealer brush designed to build coverage while blurring and diffusing for a seamless, skin-like finish.<b><br><br>Brush Formulation:</b> Liquid<br><br><b>Brush Coverage:</b> Medium <br><b><br>Bristle Type:</b> Synthetic<br><br><b>What Else You Need to Know:</b> Conceal with confidence using Patrick’s signature brush. The smaller end is dense and designed with an angled dome shape that’s perfect for building coverage with precision. The larger end has a soft, round shape for buffing, blending, and sheering out the formula to create a soft-focus finish.</div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>Small Dome Brush <br>-Use the smaller domed side to apply with precision while building coverage&mdash;perfect for the under-eyes and spot concealing. <br><br>Large Round Brush <br>-Use the larger round side to blend and diffuse the formula&mdash;ideal for softening edges and sheering out concealer for a natural look.</div></details>",
  "description_html": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><b>What it is: </b>A dual-ended concealer brush designed to build coverage while blurring and diffusing for a seamless, skin-like finish.<b><br><br>Brush Formulation:</b> Liquid<br><br><b>Brush Coverage:</b> Medium <br><b><br>Bristle Type:</b> Synthetic<br><br><b>What Else You Need to Know:</b> Conceal with confidence using Patrick’s signature brush. The smaller end is dense and designed with an angled dome shape that’s perfect for building coverage with precision. The larger end has a soft, round shape for buffing, blending, and sheering out the formula to create a soft-focus finish.</div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>Small Dome Brush <br>-Use the smaller domed side to apply with precision while building coverage&mdash;perfect for the under-eyes and spot concealing. <br><br>Large Round Brush <br>-Use the larger round side to blend and diffuse the formula&mdash;ideal for softening edges and sheering out concealer for a natural look.</div></details>",
